{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ADRIFT you find yourself behind the wheel, in the middle of nowhere, in possession of only one goal - deliver the Energy Core. Why, where and how are but questions that dance in your mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR TRUCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out in your off-road truck as you drift through winding canyons, accelerate along sand dunes, and handbrake turn your way through rocky plains in a world which has been lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.poster.avif?t=1758213092\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.webm?t=1758213092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.mp4?t=1758213092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR CARGO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock. Make sure to explore and plan your route before racing to your next safe haven. Every second the mysterious Energy Core spends in the desert heat is a second closer to your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.poster.avif?t=1758213092\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.webm?t=1758213092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.mp4?t=1758213092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A THOUSAND JOURNEYS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the serenity of a long-forgotten desert, discover what happened to this land, craft shortcuts, and plot your own route through a top-down vaporwave-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/0b9651084fc6914b29887b9cf40ec8ed.poster.avif?t=1758213092\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/0b9651084fc6914b29887b9cf40ec8ed.webm?t=1758213092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/0b9651084fc6914b29887b9cf40ec8ed.mp4?t=1758213092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2903570?t=1758213092","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/cca02aed850e14a7f2dbacde1782f964e6d668cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758213092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/954b1b2aba353d426b0eaf26436e43312b35e804/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758213092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/954b1b2aba353d426b0eaf26436e43312b35e804/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758213092","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3664660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ADRIFT you find yourself behind the wheel, in the middle of nowhere, in possession of only one goal - deliver the Energy Core. Why, where and how are but questions that dance in your mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR TRUCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out in your off-road truck as you drift through winding canyons, accelerate along sand dunes, and handbrake turn your way through rocky plains in a world which has been lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.poster.avif?t=1758213092\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.webm?t=1758213092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.mp4?t=1758213092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR CARGO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock. Make sure to explore and plan your route before racing to your next safe haven. Every second the mysterious Energy Core spends in the desert heat is a second closer to your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.poster.avif?t=1758213092\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.webm?t=1758213092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.mp4?t=1758213092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A THOUSAND JOURNEYS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the sereni